===== ISSUE 74 =====
- The **claude-watch bridge** connects the watch to that fork over loopback; dictation becomes a `session/prompt` pushed onto the SDK input stream (idle sessions wake natively).
- Stays on the **claude.ai subscription** (`--claudeai`), not API billing.

Full rationale and decision trail: `WATCH_DICTATION_ACP_PLAN.md` (in-repo, uncommitted).
